  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Minor Mental Mutation</strong></p><p>You know that they are out to get you. They are working against you in numerous ways; spying on you, sabotaging your career, stealing your trappings, turning people against you and possibly even plotting to kill you. Consult the table below, or decide a suitable Target for your suspicion together with the GM. You gain @Fear[1] towards your Target, @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.klCJX0mNpXYH5AIx]{Prejudice} (Target) and the @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.AcnFuDKRemLI9ey7]{Nose for Trouble} Talent. If you gain this mutation again, you gain an additional Target.</p><table><tbody><tr><th><p>Range</p></th><th><p>Group</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>01-05</p></td><td><p>Academics (in general or from school)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>06-10</p></td><td><p>Agitators (in general or movement)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>11-15</p></td><td><p>Burghers (in general or from city)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>16-20</p></td><td><p>Enemies of Men (Orcs or Skaven etc)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>21-25</p></td><td><p>Cult of… (Sigmar or Verena etc)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>26-30</p></td><td><p>Family of… (Rechtshandler or Voigt etc)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>31-40</p></td><td><p>Law Enforcement (in general or province)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>41-45</p></td><td><p>Guild of…(Dockhands or Bakers etc)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>46-50</p></td><td><p>Nobles (in general or from province)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>51-55</p></td><td><p>Peasants (in general or from province)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>56-60</p></td><td><p>People of… (Bretonnia or Norsca etc)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>61-65</p></td><td><p>Rogues (Charlatans or Thieves etc)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>66-70</p></td><td><p>Ruinous Powers of… (Tzeentch etc)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>71-75</p></td><td><p>Species of… (Dwarfs or Elves etc)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>76-80</p></td><td><p>Tax Collectors (in general or province)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>81-85</p></td><td><p>Undead (Vampires or Ghosts etc)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>86-90</p></td><td><p>Witches (in general or from cabal)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>91-95</p></td><td><p>Wizards (in general or from school)</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>96-100</p></td><td><p>Witchhunters</p></td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
